## ObjectType: Device Constraint

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| constraint_id | Constraint id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | constraint_id |
| device_id | Device id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | device_id |
| block_code | Block code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | block_code |
| effective_from | Effective from | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | effective_from |
| effective_to | Effective to | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | effective_to |
| constraint_type | Constraint type | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | constraint_type |
| constraint_type_code | Constraint type code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | constraint_type_code |
| cap_kw | Cap kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | cap_kw |
| reason | Reason | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | reason |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | known_date |

